Depends: python3, python3-dbus, python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, dconf-gsettings-backend, fprintd, gnome-shell
Description: S Pen and cover keyboard settings for the Galaxy Tab S9 Ultra
 Tab Companion provides a native GNOME interface for S Pen status, remote
 modes, haptics, fingerprint diagnostics and the special keys of Samsung's
 compatible keyboard covers.
